OL,3,GNEWSA'All we were trying to do was save
OL,4,Alives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been blasted for removing
OL,7,Fsafety measures installed by
OL,8,Fcampaigners at a Surrey crash hotspot.
OL,10,FThere have been multiple serious
OL,11,Fcrashes at the junction with Station
OL,12,FHill and South Street on the A31 in
OL,13,FFarnham, known as Hickley's Corner -
OL,14,Fone resulting in the death of a
OL,15,F21-year-old man.
OL,17,FCampaigner Tara Smyth said she put up
OL,18,Fbanners urging pedestrians to take care
OL,19,Fto "hopefully save lives".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
