OL,3,GNEWSA'All we were trying to do was save
OL,4,Alives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey County Council said it typically
OL,7,Fdoes not "allow banners or posters to
OL,8,Fbe erected alongside our highways due
OL,9,Fto safety and visibility concerns", but
OL,10,Fhad agreed to allow the banners to
OL,11,Fremain in place until the end of
OL,12,FAugust.
